# Authors and copyright holders

Beanbook is licensed GPL-2.0-only ([COPYING](COPYING)), with an additional permission for the
Google Play Billing Library ([LICENSE-EXCEPTION.md](LICENSE-EXCEPTION.md)). That permission is
granted by everyone listed here, so this list has to be accurate and complete: an exception is
only as good as the copyright holders standing behind it.

## Copyright holders

- WildeBeast2521 — application, engine integration, build and release tooling

## Upstream

Beanbook runs the following projects rather than reimplementing them. Their copyright belongs
to their own authors and none of it is reassigned here.

| Project | Licence |
|---|---|
| [Beancount](https://github.com/beancount/beancount) | GPL-2.0-only |
| [beanquery](https://github.com/beancount/beanquery) | GPL-2.0-only |
| [beangulp](https://github.com/beancount/beangulp) | GPL-2.0-only |
| [Fava](https://github.com/beancount/fava) | MIT |
| CPython | PSF |

The full dependency inventory, with licences, is in [docs/sbom.md](docs/sbom.md), and the
in-app licence screen is generated from the built APK by `tools/licences.py`.
